OL,3,ASexual assaults happening almost every
OL,4,Aday in Ceuta, prosecutors say
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpanish prosecutors say 23 sexual
OL,7,Fassaults, including nine against
OL,8,Fchildren, have been recorded in Ceuta
OL,9,Fsince the mass influx of migrants into
OL,10,Fthe Spanish exclave at the end of July.
OL,12,FThat number meant there was almost one
OL,13,Fcase every day, Ceuta's chief
OL,14,Fprosecutor Silvia Rojas said.
OL,16,FShe told El Pais newspaper migrant
OL,17,Fgirls were "particularly vulnerable
OL,18,Fbecause of their irregular status in
OL,19,Fthe territory".
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
